TITLE 1D transport with cation exchange

SOLUTION 0  Infilling solution
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0

SOLUTION 1-10 Initial solutions
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions constant constant
    -lengths 1
    -dispersivities 0
    -diffusion_coefficient 0
    -time_step 1
    -print_frequency 1
    -punch_frequency 1

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.txt
    -reset false

USER_PUNCH
    -headings shift cell CaX2_moles
10 PUNCH SIM_NO, CELL_NO, MOL("CaX2")

END
